## 4. 同义词扩展

### 4.1 为什么需要

BM25 是字面匹配，"大模型"搜不到只写"LLM"的文档，"微调"搜不到只写"fine-tuning"的文档。ES 的 synonym filter 在索引和查询时自动做同义词扩展，无需改服务代码。

### 4.2 同义词格式

```
// 双向同义词（逗号分隔）：a, b, c 互相等价
// 搜索 a 能命中含 b/c 的文档，反之亦然
"大模型, LLM, 大语言模型, large language model"

// 单向同义词（=> 分隔）：a => b, c
// 搜索 a 扩展为 b 和 c，但搜 b 不扩展为 a
"深度学习 => deep learning, DL"
```

### 4.3 完整索引配置

```json
PUT /article
{
  "settings": {
    "analysis": {
      "filter": {
        "ik_stop_filter": {
          "type": "stop",
          "stopwords": ["什么", "是", "的", "了", "在", "和", "与", "及", "或", "如何", "怎么", "哪些", "请", "请问", "一下", "可以", "吗", "呢", "吧", "啊"]
        },
        "synonym_filter": {
          "type": "synonym",
          "synonyms": [
            "大模型, LLM, 大语言模型, large language model",
            "微调, fine-tuning, fine tuning, 微调训练",
            "检索增强生成, RAG, retrieval augmented generation",
            "知识图谱, KG, knowledge graph",
            "向量数据库, vector database",
            "embedding, 向量化, 词嵌入",
            "知识库, knowledge base",
            "提示词, prompt",
            "图谱, graph"
          ]
        }
      },
      "analyzer": {
        "index_analyzer": {
          "type": "custom",
          "tokenizer": "ik_max_word",
          "filter": ["lowercase", "ik_stop_filter", "synonym_filter"]
        },
        "search_analyzer": {
          "type": "custom",
          "tokenizer": "ik_smart",
          "filter": ["lowercase", "ik_stop_filter", "synonym_filter"]
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "mappings": {
    "properties": {
      "title": {
        "type": "text",
        "analyzer": "index_analyzer",
        "search_analyzer": "search_analyzer"
      },
      "content": {
        "type": "text",
        "analyzer": "index_analyzer",
        "search_analyzer": "search_analyzer"
      }
    }
  }
}
```

